      <data key="e_text">A #painting for you. &quot;Broadhaven Bay&quot; came out of a time I was cycling in north County Mayo and felt like I was at the top of the world as the wind and the sun dazzled me the way they played with the landscape. I stopped and stood for hours, motionless and happy. #SpeirGorm #ArtYear</data>
