      <data key="e_edgeEnds">2025-12-02</data>
      <data key="e_text">Huge kudos to The Journal for taking on the state of trans healthcare in Ireland and centering trans voices. Please #speirgorm, especially if you don&apos;t have a trans person in your life, read this: it&apos;s hard to believe how bad things are, but it&apos;s so important that the general public knows.</data>
