      <data key="e_text">Time for another #painting. Done a long time ago. &quot;Burren Tower&quot; is on the coast of Clare. Apart from the hypnotic fields of stone, the Burren is riddled with tower houses - or what&apos;s left of them - often standing improbably with not many walls left. This is Shanmuckinish Castle. #SpeirGorm #ArtYear</data>
