      <data key="e_text">An older #painting for you. In the years before I cycled across America and Europe, I&apos;d go on day trips cycling anything from 100 km to over 200 km. I&apos;d no money so I&apos;d return home the same day. &quot;Ruined House&quot; I painted because I find our fields and their stories intoxicating. #SpeirGorm #ArtYear</data>
