      <data key="e_text">Here&apos;s a #painting. &quot;Galway Bay Rocks II&quot; came out of a cycle out the coast road from Galway city to Connemara when on the way I saw a group of kids sitting up on a large boulder and realised I&apos;d never be young again. So I painted some other rocks near by and stayed ageless. #SpeirGorm #ArtYear</data>
