      <data key="e_text">Time for a #painting I think. Of nowhere in particular and also of everywhere. I called it &quot;Green Fields&quot;. Often when walking or cycling past a scene, in my head I fly up into the sky to look down on it, as if my head has its very own satellite mapping built in. Then I paint it. #SpeirGorm #JanuArty</data>
