      <data key="e_text">A few years ago I made a series of mini drawings of interesting Irish women (available as a print here www.ciaraioch.com/artprints/p/...) - this thread is a little information on the women featured, partly because it&apos;s useful, but mostly because I&apos;m trying to be sustainable by recycling content.</data>
