      <data key="e_edgeEnds">2025-12-05</data>
      <data key="e_text">Have a #painting. &quot;O&apos;Connell Lamps&quot; came from liking the Daniel O&apos;Connell monument on the street that carries his name. Always liked those lamps too - on the bridge that also carries his name. The spire is fine, but I did like Clery&apos;s. Put it all together and I painted this view. #SpeirGorm #ArtYear</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="n740" target="n635">
