      <data key="e_text">Another #painting from another time. &quot;Slemish&quot; came out of a wonderful stay in County Antrim. On a drive to Broughshane we stopped to look at the view across to the mountain, and the landscape reminded me of when I had been cycling in (what was then the FYR) Macedonia.  #SpeirGorm #JanuArty</data>
