      <data key="e_text">There&apos;s this massive aesthetic shift that occurs when you realise all those green woods and trees are ecological deserts. Neat green lawns and bare hilltops are ugly. Big clumps of brambles and nettles are beautiful. Deciduous woods are sanctuaries. Weeds are life-giving. #speirgorm</data>
    </edge>
