      <data key="e_text">With the social media landscape artists depend on crumbling into a big lake of shite, now&apos;s a good time to mention I&apos;ve a newsletter with snippets of Irish folklore &amp; history, doodles, and fun nonsense, with zero involvement from fascist billionaires. Subscribe for free: www.ciaraioch.com/newsletter</data>
