      <data key="e_text">Here, what the heck, have a painting. Of snow, because, well y&apos;know - even if it is raining outside now. &quot;Girls In The Snow&quot; was one of dozens of paintings I painted away back when I used to do 24-hour live-streaming painting marathons. It went to a good home in Limerick. #SpeirGorm</data>
