      <data key="e_text">I really need to make tea, so you really need to see a #painting. &quot;Burren Walls&quot;, like my other Burren paintings, came out of my many trips to County Clare - because I love walls. It&apos;s hard to know what to say when you like stones. I like stones. #SpeirGorm #ArtYear</data>
