      <data key="e_text">&quot;Inishmore Horse&quot;. A special #painting for me. As an unpaid carer I don&apos;t earn much but wanted to give back. So with permission I used a friend&apos;s photo as reference, and donated half of the proceeds to the charity of their choice - the Down Syndrome Centre in Dublin&apos;s northside.  #ArtYear #SpeirGorm</data>
